WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.615 --> 00:00:05.167
Answer your first tender question with
Velstrian Bid.

2
00:00:05.795 --> 00:00:10.523
Start at the sign in page. Enter your work
email and your password,

3
00:00:10.523 --> 00:00:20.167
then select Sign in. Velstrian Tenderworks
opens on your home page.

4
00:00:20.808 --> 00:00:25.523
This is your bids list. Each row is a
tender you are working on.

5
00:00:25.523 --> 00:00:30.867
Select the bid you want to answer, and it
opens on its overview.

6
00:00:31.508 --> 00:00:34.398
Across the top you can see the stages of
the bid,

7
00:00:34.398 --> 00:00:37.643
from Tender to Sign-off and Submit and
outcome.

8
00:00:37.643 --> 00:00:42.900
You write your answers in Response, so
select Response.

9
00:00:43.541 --> 00:00:45.000
On the Response page,

10
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.932
Draft my response drafts every question it
can from your profile,

11
00:00:48.932 --> 00:00:53.530
your answer library and your past bids,
and lists anything it needs from you.

12
00:00:53.530 --> 00:00:58.167
In this bid, the questions are already
drafted.

13
00:00:58.808 --> 00:01:03.639
Your questions are listed under Tender
questions, each with its word count.

14
00:01:03.639 --> 00:01:07.333
Select the first one to open it.

15
00:01:07.948 --> 00:01:11.204
Each drafted answer is labelled AI
drafted,

16
00:01:11.204 --> 00:01:13.784
so you always know where the words came
from.

17
00:01:13.784 --> 00:01:18.367
Read it carefully, and check every figure
and claim against the tender.

18
00:01:18.367 --> 00:01:24.467
The answer is yours to change, so edit
anything that does not sound like you.

19
00:01:25.095 --> 00:01:28.209
When you are happy, select Save answer.

20
00:01:28.209 --> 00:01:33.633
Velstrian Bid confirms that it saved the
answer to this question.

21
00:01:34.234 --> 00:01:37.284
Every answer needs a person to approve it.

22
00:01:37.284 --> 00:01:41.099
Under Owner and sign-off, choose Approved
as the outcome,

23
00:01:41.099 --> 00:01:46.659
then select Record sign-off. Velstrian Bid
never submits anything for you.

24
00:01:46.659 --> 00:01:50.933
You submit through the buyer's portal
yourself.

25
00:01:51.574 --> 00:01:56.082
That is your first answer, drafted,
reviewed and approved.

26
00:01:56.082 --> 00:02:00.433
Next, repeat it for the rest of your
questions.

